# purpose: six accounts in round-robin, ~120 lines, so that a wrong balance or a skipped
#          sequence number surfaces far from where it was caused.
# exercises: interleaved OPEN/DEPOSIT/BALANCE across accounts; rejections scattered through
#            the file; balances that accumulate across many small deposits.

# open the six, with a couple of stray commands to accounts that do not exist yet
OPEN acct-01 USD
OPEN acct-02 EUR
DEPOSIT acct-05 10
OPEN acct-03 GBP
OPEN acct-04 USD
BALANCE acct-06
OPEN acct-05 EUR
OPEN acct-06 GBP

# round 1
DEPOSIT acct-01 7
DEPOSIT acct-02 12.5
DEPOSIT acct-03 0.99
DEPOSIT acct-04 250
DEPOSIT acct-04 1
DEPOSIT acct-05 1.1
OPEN acct-05 EUR
DEPOSIT acct-06 5

# round 2
DEPOSIT acct-01 64.8
DEPOSIT acct-02 0.2
DEPOSIT acct-03 10
DEPOSIT acct-04 2.5
OPEN acct-04 USD
DEPOSIT acct-05 0.75
DEPOSIT acct-06 100
DEPOSIT acct-07 1
BALANCE acct-03
BALANCE acct-08

# round 3
DEPOSIT acct-01 33.33
DEPOSIT acct-02 0.01
DEPOSIT acct-04 1
DEPOSIT acct-03 7
OPEN acct-03 GBP
DEPOSIT acct-04 12.5
DEPOSIT acct-05 0.99
DEPOSIT acct-06 250

# round 4
DEPOSIT acct-01 1.1
DEPOSIT acct-02 5
OPEN acct-02 EUR
DEPOSIT acct-03 64.8
DEPOSIT acct-04 0.2
DEPOSIT acct-05 10
DEPOSIT acct-06 2.5
BALANCE acct-05
BALANCE acct-10

# round 5
DEPOSIT acct-01 0.75
OPEN acct-01 USD
DEPOSIT acct-02 100
DEPOSIT acct-03 33.33
DEPOSIT acct-07 1
DEPOSIT acct-04 0.01
DEPOSIT acct-05 7
DEPOSIT acct-06 12.5
OPEN acct-06 GBP

# round 6
DEPOSIT acct-01 0.99
DEPOSIT acct-02 250
DEPOSIT acct-03 1.1
DEPOSIT acct-04 5
DEPOSIT acct-05 64.8
OPEN acct-05 EUR
DEPOSIT acct-010 1
DEPOSIT acct-06 0.2
BALANCE acct-01
BALANCE acct-12

# round 7
DEPOSIT acct-01 10
DEPOSIT acct-02 2.5
DEPOSIT acct-03 0.75
DEPOSIT acct-04 100
OPEN acct-04 USD
DEPOSIT acct-05 33.33
DEPOSIT acct-06 0.01

# round 8
DEPOSIT acct-01 7
DEPOSIT acct-02 12.5
DEPOSIT acct-03 0.99
OPEN acct-03 GBP
DEPOSIT acct-04 250
DEPOSIT acct-011 1
DEPOSIT acct-05 1.1
DEPOSIT acct-06 5
BALANCE acct-03
BALANCE acct-14

# final balances
BALANCE acct-01
BALANCE acct-02
BALANCE acct-03
BALANCE acct-04
BALANCE acct-05
BALANCE acct-06
